 855  FDCE 7E                   LD A,(HL)                        ; read back the character
 856  FDCF C9                   RET
 857  FDD0              ; RPC6502_SERVICE_223 -- the embedded 6502 RPC service ($FDD0-$FE41 = Apple $0DD0); its
 858  FDD0              ; own ca65 source CPM_RPC6502_223.s is sub-assembled and INCBIN'd here (the 2.20
 859  FDD0              ; CPM_RPC6502 pattern). It forms a slot-ROM pointer ($CFFF disables expansion ROM),
 860  FDD0              ; LDA ($F6),Y, and JMP ($00F6) dispatches into the selected slot-ROM/firmware routine.
 861  FDD0              RPC6502_SERVICE_223:
 862  FDD0              ;   >>> CPM_RPC6502_223.s -- verbatim listing of the INCBIN'd source (regen: inject_incbin_listing) >>>
 863  FDD0              ;
 864  FDD0              ; .org $0DD0
 865  FDD0              ;
 866  FDD0              ; L_0DD0:
 867  FDD0              ;         PHA                          ; $0DD0  48
 868  FDD0              ;         JSR SUB_0E1D                 ; $0DD1  20 1D 0E
 869  FDD0              ;         LDY #$0D                     ; $0DD4  A0 0D
 870  FDD0              ; L_0DD6:
 871  FDD0              ;         LDA ($F6),Y                  ; $0DD6  B1 F6
 872  FDD0              ;         STA $F6                      ; $0DD8  85 F6
 873  FDD0              ;         LDY $06F8                    ; $0DDA  AC F8 06
 874  FDD0              ;         PLA                          ; $0DDD  68
 875  FDD0              ;         JMP ($00F6)                ; $0DDE  6C F6 00
 876  FDD0              ; L_0DE1:
 877  FDD0              ;         PHA                          ; $0DE1  48
 878  FDD0              ;         LDA #$00                     ; $0DE2  A9 00
 879  FDD0              ;         JSR SUB_0DEF                 ; $0DE4  20 EF 0D
 880  FDD0              ;         JSR SUB_0E1D                 ; $0DE7  20 1D 0E
 881  FDD0              ;         LDY #$0F                     ; $0DEA  A0 0F
 882  FDD0              ;         JMP L_0DD6                   ; $0DEC  4C D6 0D
 883  FDD0              ; SUB_0DEF:
 884  FDD0              ;         STY $F5                      ; $0DEF  84 F5
 885  FDD0              ;         PHA                          ; $0DF1  48
 886  FDD0              ;         JSR SUB_0E14                 ; $0DF2  20 14 0E
 887  FDD0              ;         PLA                          ; $0DF5  68
 888  FDD0              ;         LDY $F5                      ; $0DF6  A4 F5
 889  FDD0              ;         BCC SUB_0DEF                 ; $0DF8  90 F5
 890  FDD0              ;         RTS                          ; $0DFA  60
 891  FDD0              ;         .byte   $00, $00, $00, $00, $00, $4C, $E9, $BB, $4C, $04, $BE, $A9, $01, $20, $EF, $0D ; $0DFB
 892  FDD0              ;         .byte   $20, $1D, $0E, $48, $A0, $0E, $4C, $D6, $0D      ; $0E0B
 893  FDD0              ; SUB_0E14:
 894  FDD0              ;         PHA                          ; $0E14  48
